==Notes==
This quest is repeatable daily.

==Requirements==
Player must complete [[Quest:Scrap Collector]] in order to do [[Quest:Hunting Treasure]].

==To Start==
Speak with [[Kara Loft]] found northwest of the [[Sanctuary]] [[Warpstones|Warpstone]].

==Goals==
Use the clue to find the lost treasure chest.

